msgstr "Ammonite Theme"

msgid "plugins.themes.ammonite.description"
msgstr "An OJS theme designed for the Geological Survey of Denmark and Greenland, based on Health Sciences. Requires the Health Sciences theme to be installed; otherwise this theme will not load its styles, templates or hooks."

msgid "plugins.themes.ammonite.parentMissing"
msgstr "The Ammonite Theme requires the Health Sciences theme to be installed. Install Health Sciences before activating Ammonite Theme; otherwise its styles and templates will not load."

